{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "60567765dc315788ed3cd76c4ee654e6072ca8304503484b1d083572460ef9e6", "ja": "うーん……どれがいいかなぁ……。\n「ツヨツヨマシマシ、パワーアーップ！」とか？", "zh": "嗯……哪个比较好呢……  \n比如“强强加倍，力量升级！”之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7f5ab79295a2b5a47d3b5cd947ed2ca2bf804908a739aeedfb6359fbec6ec81e", "ja": "どうしたんだ、麗花？\nなんだか呪文みたいなのが聞こえたが……。", "zh": "怎么了，丽花？\n好像听到了什么咒语似的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "6f2c3deaf88eff607f1c9ea17f6cc991404bcb1bba82e8e7a9cb168f93728001", "ja": "はい！　魔法少女になったので、\nどんな魔法を使おうかなーって考えてたんです。", "zh": "好的！因为我成了魔法少女，\n所以正在想要使用什么魔法呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1003_p", "source_sha256": "de5ce063aa9f6cf8fa498d871cb12a4d82f8e88434107b74f4737d54bc5b4beb", "ja": "魔法少女……って、今度の撮影の話だな。\n夢があるけど、麗花はどんな魔法を使いたいんだ？", "zh": "魔法少女……说的是下次拍摄的事吧。虽然很有梦想，不过丽花想用什么样的魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "061e39f195906177c5cf0a5a1562d00289be01103b3904b6d86090562f8959cc", "ja": "そうですね……。私なら、\n{$P$}さんの体を強くしたいです♪", "zh": "是啊……如果是我，\n我想让{$P$}先生的身体变得更强壮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "d27367131815409fa7250744cdde0cd341bfb536478a85266430346f7ad69ea5", "ja": "特製ワクワクバズーカでズド～ン！って打ち上げても\nつよつよデューサーさんなら平気ですよね？", "zh": "就算用特制的兴奋火箭筒“轰——！”地把您发射出去，强强的制作人先生也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec63a4e06a744da4a15eb450de3c72b45da488173a016f9d2321662ee48a5f87", "ja": "そしたら、{$P$}さんを\n宇宙まで連れていってあげられるなーって思って。", "zh": "那样的话，我就能把{$P$}先生带到宇宙去啦——我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4f4d382bebb6b5fbcf5027bb1aafebda5971eb9b0eddf123bb5075cb53d04765", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\nその時がきたらお手柔らかにな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……  \n真到了那时候，可要手下留情啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0362_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0362_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9ed949a8740cd5e3a2d114f7a5b55756db9d55455fc7bbc9e499bc72c8d3a34f", "ja": "（魔法に宇宙……。麗花の世界は夢で溢れているな。\nもしも魔法が使えたら、俺は何を願うんだろう……？）", "zh": "（魔法、宇宙……丽花的世界充满了梦想。要是我会使用魔法，我会许下什么愿望呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
